  "title": "CO 2 reduction on gas-diffusion electrodes and why catalytic performance must be assessed at commercially-relevant conditions",
  "abstract": "The substantial implications of high current densities on the local reaction environment and design of catalysts for electrochemical CO 2 reduction are addressed. The presented perspectives also reflect on current practices within the field and offer new opportunities for both future catalyst and system-focused research efforts.",
